#: search2:search2_92927362_E2C1_4E68_9DEE_63E8053449DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21b778e1743ae31b9336009c1573329e068f44ec01ffa0af6672d6aa5087e7fc
#. default-sha256: 59361d2269be537fa91193b1747c9767a44cba7de4d8525b42fe925d4a1e7fa8
msgctxt "search2:search2_92927362_E2C1_4E68_9DEE_63E8053449DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“I carry within me the child of God!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"「저는 주님의 아이를 잉태하였습니다!」"

#: search2:search2_A84944D9_4058_413F_9EE5_317AF8A5127D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae46c621d03d1d23030e4da0bb8ecde766d18dc7af01942696be3891b853cab1
#. default-sha256: 779a88cb9b6c7359b6411f1aba164f8abfc8f804e3301c7ec9745f036d27a28d
msgctxt "search2:search2_A84944D9_4058_413F_9EE5_317AF8A5127D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그게 모든 것의 시작이었어요."

#: search2:search2_F45BFCD5_8F99_4CBB_828C_9B089850B9D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3ea5c5be8d46a219f542e1f54a6eb291d81ae85dda5d9eaea7d86d4c6962f2b
#. default-sha256: f1772fa1774cdb182c1916c509886ce39b2a0113b702d3cf10dba92e2fbec61f
msgctxt "search2:search2_F45BFCD5_8F99_4CBB_828C_9B089850B9D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I have been visited by an angel of the Lord!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「저는 성모영보를 들었습니다!」"

#: search2:search2_C26E89B7_CD1C_450D_9AF6_8974349761C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0580c9deb7bfb48ec6519f56d3526e6bec3dea09f6c9898182fea8d6800352e5
#. default-sha256: 67201989f3f2b171612f8876d890801535ec3de36f5f8d936a28935b3e6f3216
msgctxt "search2:search2_C26E89B7_CD1C_450D_9AF6_8974349761C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Ahh, she is the child of God!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「오오, 주님의 아이여!」"

#: search2:search2_AEBF2782_1A37_447F_BB82_D469D662019C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50c7b6b4fddd48a0a0ff5d3371016f7805bcfcfedd7e1145bbdd4e313bb88873
#. default-sha256: 23b5979791079ce1727fb2b5dd928468903f1e3311496ae6c642ce2d4e29ced1
msgctxt "search2:search2_AEBF2782_1A37_447F_BB82_D469D662019C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I am with child, though I have known no man”? ⟪k:1⟫Ahaha... as if that’s even possible.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Maybe she had fooled around with a man who had gone and abandoned her, ⟪k:5⟫and she "
"spouted those lies to convince herself it had never happened.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫None of the "
"village men made any claim to be my father. ⟪k:10⟫Perhaps he was someone else’s husband, and as "
"such, he ⟪k:11⟫couldn’t⟪k:12⟫ reveal himself, as adultery is a sin in the eyes of God.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫The girl they were praising as the “child of God” was, indeed, naught more than the "
"ordinary daughter of a wretched woman."
msgstr ""
"　누구하고도 관계를 맺지 않고 잉태했다? ⟪k:0⟫아하하……, 그게 말이 되는 소린가요. ⟪k:1⟫어쩌면 제 어"
"머니는 남자에게 버려진 걸 수도 있었겠네요. ⟪k:2⟫그래서 그 사실을 잊으려고 그런 망언을 한 거겠고요."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　제 아버지라고 나서는 남자는 없었어요. ⟪k:6⟫제 아버지는 다른 여자의 남편이던 걸까"
"요. ⟪k:7⟫그렇다면 계명에 따라 불륜은 죄로 규정되니, 나서는 건 불가능했을 거예요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　"
"네, 쉽게 말해―― 주님의 아이란 축복을 받은 저는 그냥 딱한 소녀에 불과했죠."

#: search2:search2_AF36E4C0_7E91_4143_A35A_B06C398BCF5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fa8223b2945f29a234714406d66a7eaf59bc765a47fd924745463e150f552e3
#. default-sha256: 9cabbbf7321e9d82052db7e5c4b9b8408d133542de363baa73e5e821df017e88
msgctxt "search2:search2_AF36E4C0_7E91_4143_A35A_B06C398BCF5C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the time, though, I thought differently.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I believed my mother’s words, "
"convinced I was a saint. ⟪k:5⟫And it gave me a sense of duty—of purpose—rather than superiority. "
"⟪k:6⟫As the daughter of God, I believed it was my responsibility to help anyone in need.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫So every day, I prayed. ⟪k:10⟫I asked my Father what I could do—what I was ⟪k:11⟫meant⟪k:12⟫ "
"to do.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Not everyone is equally good, however. There will always be someone "
"who lends their ear to the Devil’s whispers. ⟪k:17⟫One man claimed I was the daughter of a "
"charlatan. ⟪k:18⟫He shouted for all to hear, “If you really are the child of God, then perform a "
"miracle for us.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　하지만 그 당시의 제 생각은 달랐어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　저는 어머니의 말을 믿고, 저 자신을 성녀로 "
"여긴 거죠.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　그건 자만이 아닌 사명감이었어요. ⟪k:5⟫주님의 아이로서 태어난 이상, 저는 사람"
"들을 구원해야 한다 판단했죠.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　그래서 저는 매일 꼬박 기도를 바쳤어요. ⟪k:8⟫주님의 아이인 "
"제가 과연 무엇이 가능할지―― 무엇을 이루어야 할지. ⟪k:9⟫그걸 꾸준히 여쭈었죠.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　하"
"지만 괘씸한 자는 어디에나 있는 법. ⟪k:13⟫마을 남자 하나가 「저건 사기꾼의 딸」이란 발언을 했어요. "
"⟪k:14⟫이어서 「주님의 아이가 맞다면 기적으로 증명하라」고 했죠."

#: search2:search2_C7551378_9D24_43BA_93F2_DF242D91D40C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07ba3e3bbddc00e3bd440dab14eccdbba6b90c2f3ff742d4af517b969b731cb5
#. default-sha256: 16711a3acaf6fdb036e83a8bdaf1216efc40e15ebf4dd561ac66de3e76fd8985
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7551378_9D24_43BA_93F2_DF242D91D40C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Could he have been any more unreasonable?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Miracles are neither magic nor "
"parlor tricks; ⟪k:4⟫they are realized through the power of faith. ⟪k:5⟫A lowly villager has no "
"place demanding God prove His own divinity. ⟪k:6⟫It is the height of arrogance.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫But "
"the man refused to heed my words, ⟪k:10⟫so, having no other choice,⟪k:11⟫I contemplated what I "
"could do to show him I was, indeed, a saint.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫And blood was the spark of my "
"inspiration."
msgstr ""
"　아주 어리석은 발언을 다 한다 싶었어요. ⟪k:0⟫기적은 마법이나 재롱이 아니에요. ⟪k:1⟫신앙이 실현시"
"키는 거죠. ⟪k:2⟫주님의 힘을 「증명하라」니, 한낱 마을 사람이 하기에는 주제 넘은 발언 아니겠나요? "
"⟪k:3⟫하지만 그 남자는 제 말을 듣지 않았어요. ⟪k:4⟫그래서 저는 마지못해 생각했죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　제가 "
"성녀란 걸 어떻게 증명할지를요.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　그러다―― 뇌리를 스친 게 “피”였어요."

#: search2:search2_F4EFC2B5_1D15_473B_860F_F1713F2F9BE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 608ed8dc405f6a93a70c388db4e40d3fac29dceea09233e10962446ad81fd2e9
#. default-sha256: e574a34dfd925c056f3adeb8b199cecfe481f19c0398a8049079a0dbd87b4698
msgctxt "search2:search2_F4EFC2B5_1D15_473B_860F_F1713F2F9BE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For my demonstration, I chose an elderly woman afflicted with a terrible disease. ⟪k:2⟫"
"She was on her deathbed, and no one thought she would live for longer than another day or two."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The woman was overjoyed when I came to visit her. ⟪k:7⟫Sincerely believing me "
"to be a holy servant of the Lord, she gathered all the strength she could muster to climb from "
"her bed and kiss my feet.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I felt an intensely deep love for this woman.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫Placing my hands upon her cheeks, I said with all the kindness in my heart,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　저는 노파 한 명을 골랐어요. ⟪k:1⟫노파는 중병을 앓아서 누구나 오늘내일할 몸으로 여겼죠.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　노파는 제 방문을 몹시 반겼어요. ⟪k:5⟫저를 진심으로 성녀라 믿었죠. ⟪k:6⟫성녀의 방문에 "
"감격하여, 침대에서 가까스로 그 노구를 일으켜 제 발끝에 입맞춤을 하는 모습을 보고―― 제 마음은 자애"
"심으로 가득 찼어요.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　저는 노파의 뺨에 손을 대며 자애롭게 선언했어요."

#: search2:search2_02E51490_984D_46B5_828E_15AC21AB4FEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19b7eb017280f59f01ca590c6892c9a355fe8c77641e93aedde070f166fc11b6
#. default-sha256: 6b3e8fe04083c0d62e0fcb14e97d3551f1be6968674e604cb7ae0419fe52ef73
msgctxt "search2:search2_02E51490_984D_46B5_828E_15AC21AB4FEE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“My beloved sister, ⟪k:4⟫partake of my blood.”⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「사랑스러운 이웃이여, 제 피를 머금으십시오」"

#: search2:search2_C7614FF8_B1F4_4682_B652_1C2D5D133B13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3decd75e5d77ce2314f34ecaca4730af0cf5183bd834f8bd2798a42d395f591
#. default-sha256: 5195edef4f8117b69d6922e806dd94126469b5378a43f5b87a292ca272acd653
msgctxt "search2:search2_C7614FF8_B1F4_4682_B652_1C2D5D133B13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The woman agreed without a glimpse of hesitation. ⟪k:6⟫And so I "
"pricked the tip of my finger with a knife and let the blood drip into her mouth.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"Within three days, her health had improved enough for her to get out of bed unassisted.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Seeing that, no one in the village doubted my powers any longer. ⟪k:14⟫In fact, "
"the man who had accused me of being “the daughter of a charlatan” was subsequently punished for "
"his sins. ⟪k:15⟫He received much-deserved retribution for challenging the daughter of God—for "
"mocking her.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫But of course, being a saint, I forgave the man. ⟪k:20⟫He, in "
"turn, repented and changed his ways, worshiping me as the true child of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　노파는 망설이지 않고 제 말을 따랐어요. ⟪k:5⟫저는 나이프로 손끝을 그어, "
"제 피를 노파에게 주었죠.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　그런 후에 노파의 병세는 점점 나아져서―― 사흘 후에는 침대에서 "
"일어나기까지 했어요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　이 시점에서 제 힘을 의심하는 자는 마을에 남지 않았어요. "
"⟪k:11⟫심지어 사람들은 「사기꾼의 딸」 발언을 한 남자를 처벌하려 했어요. ⟪k:12⟫주님의 아이를 의심하"
"며 비웃었으니, 크나큰 죄를 저지른 거였죠. ⟪k:13⟫그건 당연한 벌이었어요.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　하지만 "
"물론 저는 성녀라서―― 그 남자를 용서했어요. ⟪k:17⟫그러자 남자는 개심하여, 저를 주님의 아이로 인정하"
"고 숭배하기 시작했어요."

#: search2:search2_40CC0FB9_61BE_47BD_8D74_485C3F68759F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e46ff6bc6268f6f98ba91fb6ddd362bed8531e4dddc10f571c8f805d7f71e8e1
#. default-sha256: dbb7eb295fce92e25ac4db17445705e01b0dac3e0064e98ae9fa6e0624807103
msgctxt "search2:search2_40CC0FB9_61BE_47BD_8D74_485C3F68759F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, I’ll be honest with you—⟪k:2⟫I was ecstatic. ⟪k:3⟫Utterly elated. ⟪k:4⟫I felt like "
"I was on top of the world, and I reveled in it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The villagers showered me with "
"adulation. ⟪k:8⟫They revered me—the daughter of God. ⟪k:9⟫Anyone who didn’t was punished.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫And on top of that, my blood could cause miracles.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Tell me, do you "
"look down on me for feeling the way I did? ⟪k:16⟫The ⟪k:17⟫actual⟪k:18⟫ child of God would never "
"let herself be consumed by such base emotions, would she?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　똑똑히 말할게요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　저는 그때, 흥분에 빠져 있었어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　몸 속에서 솟구치는 "
"고양감에 몸을 맡겼죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　누구나 저를 주님의 아이라 부르며, 칭찬하고, 숭배하잖아요.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫　저를 의심하는 자는 벌을 받잖아요.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　그 뿐만 아니라――⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　제 피에는 기적"
"의 힘이 있잖아요.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　미셸, 이 사실에 웃고 싶을 만큼 흥분한 저를……⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　당신은 혐"
"오하시겠나요?⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　진정으로 주님의 아이였다면……⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫　이런 천한 감정을 품지는 않았"
"겠죠?"

#: search2:search2_77934C7F_F599_4009_A939_24713B872DAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fae3d8478abc8fac5bfef8068aff2acc2289108309b419cca3a5125516560496
#. default-sha256: d144361cea918cd6ed33847531f25616d3995f465b0591b7180c52b223276de6
msgctxt "search2:search2_77934C7F_F599_4009_A939_24713B872DAC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not my place to decide whether my blood truly had miraculous powers or not. ⟪k:2⟫"
"If you think it did, then it did, and if you think it was all happenstance, then so it was.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Miracles are brought about by faith... ⟪k:6⟫so the elderly woman who was healed was "
"done so by the power of her own belief. ⟪k:7⟫Baseless hope and desire can, at times, make the "
"otherwise impossible reality.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫You understand just how major a role religion "
"played in our time, don’t you, Michel? ⟪k:12⟫Especially as someone whose life was taken from him "
"in the name of God.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫And you understand how powerful word of mouth can be as "
"well, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　제 피에 기적의 힘이 있는지 여부――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　이를 정하는 건 제가 아니에요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　있다"
"고 믿으면 있는 거고, 우연으로 치부하면 우연인 거죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　기적은 신앙이 일으키는 것…….⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫　그러니 저를 믿던 노파가 병을 극복한 것도 신앙 덕분일걸요. ⟪k:9⟫맹신적이고 강한 의지와 기도"
"는 종종 불가능해 보이는 것도 실현시키거든요.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　미셸……, 당신이라면 우리 시대에 신"
"앙이 얼마나 중요했는지 이해하시죠? ⟪k:13⟫신앙 때문에 목숨을 잃은 당신이라면요……. ⟪k:14⟫그리고 사람"
"의 말이 얼마나 큰 무게감을 띠고 전해지는지도 이해하시죠?"

#: search2:search2_F7235EA6_F32F_435D_93D6_4B66D7802AD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b14bd5a02de74e13a58af38a4512dc25f8a751d64f3b426cbc9334402b978b5
#. default-sha256: b5cbc0a8d7aedeaf89bd9a090e6e6e6421f5e2d0ade003469f3eacf6b06098e7
msgctxt "search2:search2_F7235EA6_F32F_435D_93D6_4B66D7802AD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There were some for whom no miracle took place, but whenever that would happen the "
"villagers would come out and say, “The daughter of God is not to blame; you simply lack "
"sufficient faith.” ⟪k:2⟫Thus, such incidents had no negative effect on my reputation as a saint."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫For three years, I continued doling out blessings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　개중에는 기적이 실현되지 않은 자도 있었는데, 그런 자에게는 마을 사람들이 「이건 성녀 때문"
"이 아니라, 네 신앙이 부족한 탓」이라며 알아서 비난했기에, 저는 태연히 성녀로 존재할 수 있었죠."
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　그리고 성녀인 채로 3년이 지났어요."

#: search2:search2_4297A524_1A44_4DFC_8149_BC08F0C17B25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d507badbc6b60812a1b10a26d1314b5e2d63aa9144c30c440d4a6613f2d49c87
#. default-sha256: 5eddb5d763caa52ec880a84e51ab9c1b8e2514578b7db3c35023b0873f49c02b
msgctxt "search2:search2_4297A524_1A44_4DFC_8149_BC08F0C17B25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, while I was offering a prayer, my mother let slip her discontent:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫“Why must you hand out miracles for nothing? ⟪k:5⟫Why must you give strangers grace? ⟪k:6⟫We "
"should be getting compensated. ⟪k:7⟫We ⟪k:8⟫deserve⟪k:9⟫ remuneration. ⟪k:10⟫If we charged just a "
"little bit for each blessing, we could be living so much more comfortably.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　다른 날처럼 주님께 기도를 바치던 날, 불만을 토로한 건 제 어머니였어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　왜 무상으"
"로 기적을 제공하느냐.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　왜 무상으로 베풀려 하느냐.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　우리는 시주를 받아야 한다. "
"⟪k:7⟫그럴 권리가 있다.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　조금씩만 시주를 받다 보면 이 생활은 더 풍족해진다――."

#: search2:search2_7E03B668_2332_464F_A3C6_D3A85FD3F6C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbf14df56d65d8ab3ae699ad8dd8a3601343ccb07537e3f3a0da5947bc58f3f1
#. default-sha256: f50abe40e74ea3408c451613674ec2c66ec2c7a821ee6dcecef90a60749aae32
msgctxt "search2:search2_7E03B668_2332_464F_A3C6_D3A85FD3F6C7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was dumbfounded. ⟪k:2⟫How could the mother of a saint say such things? ⟪k:3⟫Helping "
"people was my divine calling—and she expected ⟪k:4⟫payment⟪k:5⟫?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I nearly wept, "
"hearing my mother preoccupied with such worldly desires.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫So I explained to "
"her how important this work was. ⟪k:13⟫I taught her that we were not to covet material wealth, "
"that we were to dedicate our lives to the service of our fellow man.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫“You’re "
"right, my dear saint,” she said, understanding.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫And I believed her. I fell "
"asleep that night convinced she truly understood and that there would be no more problems."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　저는 놀랐어요. ⟪k:1⟫성녀의 어머니가 무슨 소린가 싶어 제 귀를 의심했죠. ⟪k:2⟫사람들을 구원하"
"는 게 사명인데, 돈이 필요하다? ⟪k:3⟫별 속물적인 욕망을 품길래, 슬퍼서 눈물까지 나올 지경이었어요."
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　그래서 저는 극진한 마음으로 우리의 행위가 얼마나 존귀한지 설득했어요. ⟪k:7⟫우리"
"는 사치라는 속세의 욕망을 버리고, 사람들을 위해 살아야 한다고 했죠.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　그때 어머니는 「네 "
"말이 맞아, 내 성녀님」이라며 납득했어요.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　저는 어머니의 말과 마음을 믿고, 모든 게 잘 "
"풀릴 거라 확신한 채 잠들었어요."

#: search2:search2_28E35D2F_DBEC_4F37_B683_34DDBD18D58B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9916d8160a6595d3535ae488391e9a18c277378e10b765fa53d5b6850062c65a
#. default-sha256: ce91213482710f900ad6df377bff27b886a8dbf89042fd6ea4d5f69e19e6a19a
msgctxt "search2:search2_28E35D2F_DBEC_4F37_B683_34DDBD18D58B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I decided it was a trial.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My Father, the Lord God, was testing my "
"worthiness of being⟪k:5⟫His daughter. ⟪k:6⟫So I choked back my urge to cry and sat there in "
"silent contemplation.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫For almost three weeks was I rocked around in the "
"carriage.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The coachman treated me well enough, but I’m certain it was only because he "
"didn’t want his precious cargo dying before he could⟪k:13⟫deliver it. ⟪k:14⟫He did not, by any "
"means, think me the child of God."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　저는 이를 “시련”으로 여기기로 했어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　제 아버지인 주님께서 제가 딸이기에 걸맞는"
"지 시험하시는 거죠.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　그래서 저는 울음을 참고, 입을 꾹 닫고만 있었어요.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　"
"마차는 3주 가까이 달렸어요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　마부는 저를 죽게 하기 싫은지, 그럭저럭 좋게 대했는데―― 그"
"건 “귀한 상품”을 대하는 태도였을 거예요. ⟪k:10⟫제가 주님의 아이란 걸 결코 믿진 않았어요."

#: search2:search2_406D943E_A177_4E51_A89A_1E6647B3CCB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c159c90f10d05a9ef573a3b9b9d5219c77961ceb36b5bc404a27c34b5c2d805e
#. default-sha256: eb75400369f9cd76b4a405ee8728efd8f6ffa3309d0d9832075229d621f29bc1
msgctxt "search2:search2_406D943E_A177_4E51_A89A_1E6647B3CCB7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Welcome, daughter of God.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’ll be performing miracles for me now.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「반갑네, 성녀님. 앞으로는 나를 위해 기적을 일으키도록」"

#: search2:search2_5E3A5AA6_16B8_479F_A263_8C4A5CA62EF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71187cecee2a743176d8448de83d14e1ba28d9d885bf28482c000b74d560d7d7
#. default-sha256: c3c9cc2477f7adab3eab02ca3c767236cd0fff4c3795f71d7d98d99810c9b2d9
msgctxt "search2:search2_5E3A5AA6_16B8_479F_A263_8C4A5CA62EF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Miracles are not something to be performed for one single person’s benefit,” ⟪k:2⟫I "
"replied, shocked and furious he had just said something so utterly blasphemous.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In "
"response, he said, “I ⟪k:6⟫bought⟪k:7⟫ you. You are my property. You have no right to an "
"opinion.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫But I would not have any of it. I entreated him to give up his indulgent "
"lifestyle and devote himself to the service of the Lord.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫But the more I "
"pleaded, the deeper the creases on his face grew.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Thinking back on it now, it "
"was hardly surprising. ⟪k:18⟫A nine-year-old girl was scolding the most powerful man in the "
"region. ⟪k:19⟫I believed it was my duty, and that I was only doing what was right, but he surely "
"saw it as incredible arrogance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　기적이란 개인을 위해 일으키는 게 아니에요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　그 당시의 저는 그 모독적인 말에 분개"
"하여, 영주를 타이르려 했어요. ⟪k:3⟫영주는 저에게 「너는 이미 내가 산 몸이다. 선택의 여지는 없어」"
"라 말했지만, 저는 결코 수긍하지 않았어요. ⟪k:4⟫심지어 회개하여 이런 사치를 끊고, 주님께 경건하라 "
"선언했죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　하지만 제가 말을 할수록 영주의 표정은 매서워졌어요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　뭐…… 지"
"금 생각하면 당연한 거겠죠? ⟪k:10⟫고작 아홉 살짜리 소녀가 땅을 장악한 권력자 영주를 꾸짖은 거잖아"
"요? ⟪k:11⟫그 당시의 저는 그게 제 책무이자 당연한 행동이라 여겼지만, 영주에게는 오만해 보였을 거예"
"요."

#: search2:search2_1A678B86_7D11_4FDA_844C_469738277C30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7420a255f1d59bf174932ccb92424f687246404b5fe43fda948c1fe0fbbe75c6
#. default-sha256: 44bfb64fb2a1dd9f7012a8d128a5ac75636959fdd9eda0c7b059e278a2e37381
msgctxt "search2:search2_1A678B86_7D11_4FDA_844C_469738277C30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“A saint’s blood and good fortune to all!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「여러분께 성녀의 피와 축복을!」"

#: search2:search2_17960355_07F9_4DB3_8BAE_2E363F7AEE82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d5ee298aa41c3dc8ced9ec6e84f94acd10c747e2af1c4c79fc59d9d08f045f1
#. default-sha256: e1d4647887e5db5766b9f79cec4537635b93c060e563e4e02822462e93b8adde
msgctxt "search2:search2_17960355_07F9_4DB3_8BAE_2E363F7AEE82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That was when I realized, ⟪k:6⟫the lord was only interested in the "
"approval of others. ⟪k:7⟫He reveled in their envy as he pranced about, showing off his curious "
"new toy—⟪k:8⟫me.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫He didn’t need my miracles.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Neither he, nor any "
"of his guests were afflicted with disease or misfortune. ⟪k:15⟫They were all richly blessed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　――저는 깨달았어요.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　영주가 원한 건 남들의 칭찬에 불과하단 사"
"실. ⟪k:7⟫진귀한 것을 입수하여, 이를 아낌없이 대접하는 본인에게 쏠릴 선망을 원한단 사실. ⟪k:8⟫저는 "
"그것만을 위한 도구란 사실을.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　기적은 필요하지도 않던 거였어요.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　영주는 물론"
"이고 내빈객 중 누구도 병을 앓지 않았어요. ⟪k:13⟫다들 부유하며 풍족했죠."

#: search2:search2_392C0EAA_FE9E_45BB_9F37_E954A3C2F803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e85d61bf2c3bd65baf9b59fb4731e9abb00ac7e629a0f6b83c2be7c09faa1dce
#. default-sha256: e69d33a1c69b030800e9a4797c34baa107321bd0cc3b9b6bca465c0696be782c
msgctxt "search2:search2_392C0EAA_FE9E_45BB_9F37_E954A3C2F803"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For a while, I was convinced it was all God’s test.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That it was part of "
"His plan for me, His daughter.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That if I could make it through this trial, I would "
"be allowed to go back to helping people.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That man would celebrate my success. Envy "
"me. Worship me.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫That sinners would face punishment.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫That divine "
"retribution would be delivered unto all who had wronged me, a saint.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫With "
"each passing day, my spirit grew more twisted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　처음에는 이 또한 시련이라 여겼어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　주님의 아이이기에 주어진 숙명.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　"
"이 시련을 극복하면,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　나는 베푸는 쪽으로 돌아갈 수 있으리라…….⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　사람들은 나를 "
"축복하고, 선망하고, 숭배하리라…….⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　죄를 범한 자들은 벌을 받으리라…….⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　성녀"
"를 이렇게 만든 자들에게……⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　모두 고르게 천벌이 떨어질 것이리라.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　……"
"제 마음은 점점 일그러졌어요."

#: search2:search2_BF09B8E4_2AFD_44B8_B239_F40919211AA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edbbe2cf397b7e5912ba0791e10451d5a6fbd7c9143b52b8fcdcbb248f151c51
#. default-sha256: 0acc99ca1a971b3bdce38d5777023187446d741ed623bc3272b652bbe7a0396d
msgctxt "search2:search2_BF09B8E4_2AFD_44B8_B239_F40919211AA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Would anyone have believed that scarred and bloodied girl tied up on the floor in the "
"banquet hall was a ⟪k:2⟫saint⟪k:3⟫? ⟪k:4⟫Unlikely. This was no charitable gathering, but an "
"unholy sabbat.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Perhaps it was caused by my corrupted spirit. ⟪k:9⟫Perhaps it "
"was my heart’s way of crying for help. ⟪k:10⟫Or perhaps it was the Devil giving me my witch’s "
"mark. ⟪k:11⟫But no matter what the cause, during one of the bloody banquets, I underwent a "
"transformation.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I was half-conscious, as usual, when one of the guests pointed "
"at me and shouted something. ⟪k:15⟫His face went pale, as if he were afraid, which I found quite "
"curious. ⟪k:16⟫The lord then approached me, grabbing me by the hair and lifting my head. ⟪k:17⟫He "
"yelled something, but I was too far gone to be able to make out what he was saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　이 연회를 보고……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　피투성이가 된 저를 보고, 누가 성녀라 여길까요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　이는 "
"성녀의 베풂과 기적이 아닌――⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　그냥 사바트 같았어요.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　제 마음이 일그러진 탓"
"일까요.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　궁지에 몰린 제 마음이 비명을 지른 거였을까요.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　아니면 그게 곧 마"
"녀의 낙인이었을까요.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　아무튼 피의 연회 중에 제게 이변이 일어났어요.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　여전"
"히 흐리고 몽롱한 의식 속에서…… 내빈객 중 한 명이 저를 손가락질하며 소리쳤어요. ⟪k:18⟫그 얼굴이 창"
"백하고 겁에 질려 있었기에, 저는 의문이 들었어요. ⟪k:19⟫이어서 영주가 다가와 제 머리채를 잡곤 소리"
"쳤어요. ⟪k:20⟫하지만 저는 이미 그 자들의 말을 알아들을 상태가 아니었어요."

