msgctxt "search2:search2_5AC72E41_4150_4A5B_B5AC_447276CF9678"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“How... can you be so calm?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Do you understand what you’ve done?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「어떻게…… 멀쩡히 굴 수 있는 건데!?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　무슨 짓을 저질렀는지 알기"
"나 해……!?」"

#: search2:search2_AC49DB02_5520_4208_A28B_6BC3497DBF5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d02c32744058b23735a4bc194198e880825cba194337520c17d8a686d45971fa
