msgctxt "search2:search2_D6E05552_4E2F_43D9_869A_968020C89F4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So I made my next wish.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wished for their reconstruction.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I wished eternal suffering on their souls.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I wished to trap them in a neverending "
"cycle of pain and hatred."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　그래서―― 저는,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　다음 기도를 했어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　그 자들의 재생을.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　그 자"
"들의 혼에 영원한 고통을.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　그 자들을 제 증오의 굴레에 가두어――⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　영원히 고통받"
"게 하고자……."

#: search2:search2_FE3D1120_E72C_48DB_AB18_059719F975AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c3062c7f6ec969794101dbc5abeaa9cef59c015e5aab690bac4f492ebff94a7
