msgctxt "search2:search2_FE3D1120_E72C_48DB_AB18_059719F975AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫This was my wish for the flaxen-haired young man:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He treasured his "
"dear sister, and he desired a quiet life, ⟪k:6⟫so I wished for him to have just that. ⟪k:7⟫And I "
"wished for his dearly beloved sister to love him more than anything in the world! ⟪k:8⟫For his "
"world to be destroyed by love gone too far!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　아마빛 머리칼 청년에게는 이런 기도를 바쳤어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　청년은 여동생을 진심으로 아끼며, "
"평화로운 생활을 바랐죠.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　그래서 청년이 바라는 대로 평온하고 좋은 생활을 보내기를――⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫　저도 기도해 주었어요.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　그리고 청년이 끔찍이 아끼던 여동생에게――⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　진심"
"으로 사랑받기를!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　과도한 사랑으로 파멸하기를!"

#: search2:search2_3575F672_880D_4535_A24E_D9CC7C0E5B67
