msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My wish for the lord was more straightforward:⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He seemed to have "
"great affection for wealth and authority, so I ensured those were the only things he could ever "
"have. ⟪k:6⟫Who needs love or friendship when you could be drowning in power? ⟪k:7⟫Once he had "
"lost everything, ⟪k:8⟫his solitude would be his only companion!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　영주에게는 훨씬 단순한 기도를 바쳤어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　영주는 돈과 권력에 사족을 못 쓰나 보니, "
"그것만 얻으란 기도를 바쳤죠.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　돈과 권력만 있으면 사랑과 우정은 필요도 없겠죠?⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫　힘에만 취하면 그만 아니겠어요.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　그리고 모든 걸 잃고――⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　고독만이 이웃"
"이 되기를!"

